t;padding-left:5.3pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;執行役員&lt;/p&gt;
